:: Sister Office Printer [micro_event event nobr] {"position":"1550,3400","size":"100,100"}
/* Inline micro event in the Stage 1 main room (micro event 42, "A normal workday" in Define Events): the printer
   ate her report and she's negotiating with it. I can fix it myself (her) or call $brian over (Morale). */
<div class="activity-image-wrapper" style="max-height: 400px">
	<<DisplayActivity $sister>>
</div>
<p>The printer by the window is jammed, and $sister.callName is kneeling in front of it with the side panel open, talking to it in the low, patient voice people use on a dog that has run off with a sock.</p>
<<silently>>
<<set _msgs to [
	{ who: $sister, text: "Come on, just give it back. I'm asking nicely, and I won't be asking nicely for much longer." },
	{ who: $player, text: "How's it going?" },
	{ who: $sister, text: "It ate my internship report, all eleven pages, and now it's keeping them somewhere in there where my hand doesn't fit." },
	{ who: $sister, text: "I've been feuding with the one at college since September, and I'm starting to think they talk to each other." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>
<br>
<div id="sister-printer-choice" class="choices">
	<div>
		<<link "Fix it yourself">>
			<<replace "#sister-printer-choice">>
				<p>I crouch down next to her, pull the green lever she was very carefully not touching and slide out page seven, folded into a perfect little accordion. She takes it from me with both hands.</p>
				<<silently>>
				<<set _msgs to [
					{ who: $sister, text: "Thank you. I was about two minutes away from kicking it." },
					{ text: "Then she sees me reading the upside-down page over her hands, and she flips it against her chest." },
					{ who: $player, text: "'My supervisor is demanding but fair'?" },
					{ who: $sister, text: "That's from the evaluation template, I didn't come up with it. Stop reading over my hands." },
				]>>
				<</silently>>
				<<Chat _msgs>>
				<p>She doesn't push me away, though. We kneel there in front of the open printer for another minute while she smooths page seven flat on her knee, and her shoulder stays against mine the whole time.</p>
				<<UpdateStat "+" "SisterRelation" 1>>
			<</replace>>
		<</link>>
	</div>
	<div>
		<<link "Call $brian.name over">>
			<<replace "#sister-printer-choice">>
				<<silently>>
				<<set _msgs to [
					{ who: $player, text: "$brian.name? Printer emergency." },
					{ text: "He's there in about four seconds. He doesn't look at her. He looks at the printer, reaches past her without touching her, pulls the green lever and hands her page seven, all in one movement." },
					{ who: $brian, text: "Um. The green parts. You can pull those." },
					{ who: $sister, text: "Good to know. Does that work on everything, or just printers?" },
					{ who: $brian, text: "Hm. Printers. Mostly." },
				]>>
				<</silently>>
				<<Chat _msgs>>
				<p>She thanks him three times. He says 'yep' to the printer and walks back to his desk faster than I've ever seen him walk anywhere. Later, on my way past, I notice a strip of green electrical tape wrapped around the handle of the paper tray. Nobody owns up to it.</p>
				<<UpdateStat "+" "Morale" 1>>
			<</replace>>
		<</link>>
	</div>
</div>
